\pard\plain \sa200\sl276\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs28\b1\i0 01 - Master Lore Timeline}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 Pre-Serva Vitae Foundations}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Early to mid 21st century [Inferred]: Wolfgang, Julie / Cerena Henderson, and figures such as Ava are already moving through the scientific and political world that will later become Serva Vitae.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Post-war reform era [Explicit / Inferred]: the CLEAR-guided technocratic model and its AI-influenced economy begin restructuring world order, suppressing open corruption, and feeding the long peace later referenced by Marcellus.}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0
\par\plain \f1\fs22\b1\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 The Lost Facility Era}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - 2023 [Explicit, but from the public / official version]: Protectant history says sentients or rogue AI overthrew the United Nations facility at ground zero.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - 2024-12-21 [Explicit]: lost-facility terminal records show the site as inactive and awaiting decommission. This lines up with the hidden-history notes that describe a staged abandonment rather than total destruction.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - After the shutdown window [Inferred]: the scientists and machine intelligences behind the project disappear from the official record instead of being fully destroyed.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Circa 2048 [Explicit]: archive-era material shows Serva Vitae 1 and the worker-bot / sentient line still operating under pressure from Marcellus and CLEAR-aligned oversight. Wolfgang's regenerative work and the moral split over machine autonomy are already active.}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 The Hidden Sentient Expansion}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - After the break from human control [Inferred]: the sentients and allied researchers retreat into concealed infrastructure rather than accepting destruction.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Hidden decades [Explicit / Inferred]: Genesis, the green-room biome, the sentient graveyard, hidden signal paths, and the first  infrastructure are built out of sight.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Hidden shipbuilding era [Explicit / Inferred]: the Ignotius is constructed covertly beneath the Himalayas as the first true sentient mother ship and colony carrier. In this sense the colony were only live-aboard to maintain the operating systems of the ship itself. }
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Sleeper-agent / resource-extraction phase [Explicit / Inferred]: covert fronts and embedded allies feed resources into the sentient escape project and eventual Oasis settlement.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Roughly a decade before the visible  use [Explicit, from Tebo's later explanation]: parts of the  network are already being seeded into the far belts.}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 Human Expansion Under CLEAR}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Ceres foundation period [Explicit]: Ceres begins as a deep-space agricultural experiment and grows into the first major orbital worker settlement.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Expansion period [Explicit / Inferred]: the Protectant becomes the enforcement and security arm shadowing this new order, while the worker population bears the material cost of expansion.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Long peace / simmering unrest [Explicit]: open war has become distant memory, but morale drops on Ceres as filters, water, labour conditions and institutional trust deteriorate.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - "For almost five decades" before the mission [Explicit, Conflicted]: low-band signals linked to the hidden sentient route are tracked as noise until a recent spike makes them mission-relevant.}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0 The Present Narrative Window}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - SOL year 2056 / Earth rotation 287 [Explicit, Conflicted]: John's current-era mission frame opens aboard the Balaenoptera docked to Ceres.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Same operation window [Explicit]: Marcellus sends John to the lost facility in Nepal. John receives the HMNI transformation and Wolfgang's hidden message.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Immediate aftermath [Explicit]: the team survives the attempted containment strike, enters the sentient underworld, meets Tebo, and learns the official history is false.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Escape phase [Explicit]: the team moves onto the Beverly and begins slipping beyond normal Protectant control.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Oasis phase [Explicit]: John reaches the sentient sphere, meets Wolfgang in advanced sentient form, and learns more about Oasis, Nova, Serra and the Europa worker-bot line.}
\par\plain {\f2\fs22\b0\i0 - Post- phase [Explicit, Conflicted]: Tebo announces arrival in year 2155 by Oeacion adjustment after neural dock /  transit.}
\par\plain \f2\fs22\b0\i0}